[ti:The Black Velvet Band]
[ar:Traditional]
[00:00.00]In a neat little town they call Belfast
[00:08.88]Apprenticed to trade I was bound
[00:19.52]And many an hour of sweet happiness
[00:23.28]I spent in that neat little town
[00:30.00]Her eyes they shone like diamonds
[00:36.96]I thought her the queen of the land
[00:43.76]And her hair hung over her shoulder
[00:50.56]Tied up with a black velvet band
